cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the twelveviews pipeline or its synthetic data, also cite the software."
title: "twelve-views-thai-tourism: a data-shape-driven framework for the visual analysis of Thai tourism, with code and synthetic data"
abstract: >-
  Open, single-command pipeline for a data-shape-driven framework of twelve
  coordinated views of inbound tourism (unit chart, radial spiral, streamgraph,
  ridgeline plot, Sankey and chord diagrams, hierarchical edge bundling, circle
  packing, sunburst, beeswarm, parallel coordinates and a t-SNE embedding map),
  evaluated by a simulation study in which known structure is planted in ten
  synthetic datasets and its recovery is measured.
type: software
authors:
